# FlintTrade — site

Read `packages/apps/site/CLAUDE.md` first. This is the public docs and marketing site built with Next.js/Fumadocs.

## Rules
- Consume shared primitives through `@flinttrade/design-system`.
- Keep CSP nonce handling intact; do not add script-src `unsafe-inline`.
- Keep docs paths in sync with the restructured package tree.
- Run site build/typecheck after changing config, MDX, or shared UI imports.
- Update screenshots or visual baselines for user-visible layout changes.
